Reading: the first item starts 57 px below the frame top (1 px border + 40 px header + 16 px); clicking selects the whole name; Enter commits and announces, Escape restores, typing is capped at 40 characters with an ellipsis at rest, an empty name returns to the default; the default follows DE/EN while a typed name stays; the title follows the frame when it shrinks, fades with the collapse, the ghost already shows "Neue Zone" and the grouped zone keeps it; no overflow at 390 px; reduced motion: title transition 0s; one edge element throughout.

